/1173681153/events/428839331.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n          <event id=\"428839332\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[23 Jul 2026 - 19:00 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 18:15) DISCLOSURE DAY]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-23T19:00:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-23T18:15:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428839332</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute></event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681153/events/428839332/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681153/events/428839332.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173687384\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[EFFI O BLAENAU]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<font size=\"5\"><b>Effi O Blaenau&nbsp;</b></font><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/kcyocfuekasjcuueaxhvbf182sz3/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre(s): Drama</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">UK| 2026| 91 mins (Welsh with <b>English Subtitles)</b>.</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director: Marc Evans</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Stars:&nbsp;Leisa Gwenllian, Tom Rhys Harries, Owen Alun</font></div><div><p><font size=\"3\"><em>Based on the acclaimed\none-woman play </em><i>Iphigenia in Splott</i><em>, this Welsh-language</em> film version moves the action to the\nNorth Wales town of Blaenau, a dreary place\nsurrounded by grey slate tips, where Effi tries desperately to enjoy life on\nthe dole through a haze of clubbing and alcohol. An encounter with a disabled\nsoldier seems to promise her some hope, but things soon descend into chaos&hellip; But\nEffi fights back. Leisa Gwenllian gives a tour-de-force\nperformance as Effi, and aided by Evans&rsquo;s direction, she has you rooting for\nher character as fate and the elements conspire against her. An affecting and\nmoving drama in the British social realist tradition.</font></p></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>film</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687384/events</url>\n        <version>41</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/vjo0gpbaqynt5oys8n2coj08w0ep/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/vjo0gpbaqynt5oys8n2coj08w0ep/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/vjo0gpbaqynt5oys8n2coj08w0ep/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/kcyocfuekasjcuueaxhvbf182sz3/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/kcyocfuekasjcuueaxhvbf182sz3/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/v