A[<div>\n<b><font size=\"5\">Fame&nbsp;</font></b><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/2clpgi8t9t4l6s3xvm9k58yuw1jl/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre(s):&nbsp;Drama/Musical</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">USA| 1980 | 134 Mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director: Alan Parker</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Stars:&nbsp;Eddie Barth, Lee Curreri, Irene Cara.</font></div><div><span><font size=\"3\">Set in New York&rsquo;s High School of Performing Arts,&nbsp;<b><i>Fame&nbsp;</i></b>follows a disparate group of students from different backgrounds as they audition and then study at the school. We see how they progress across four years of study, as they aim to make it big in their chosen areas of the entertainment world. Various audition and performance scenes, along with the characters&rsquo; personal experiences are expertly woven into Christopher Gore&rsquo;s screenplay, and the result is a joyful celebration of youth, hope and talent.&nbsp;</font></span></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>Relaxed Screening</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687383/events</url>\n        <version>33</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/abr5xcxov16fep28nv4t9bpfk05k/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/abr5xcxov16fep28nv4t9bpfk05k/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/abr5xcxov16fep28nv4t9bpfk05k/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/2clpgi8t9t4l6s3xvm9k58yuw1jl/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/2clpgi8t9t4l6s3xvm9k58yuw1jl/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/2clpgi8t9t4l6s3xvm9k58yuw1jl/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n        </images>\n        <properties>\n          <property>\n            <name>Trailer</name>\n            <value>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGKeFD3mIa8</value>\n          </property>\n        </properties>\n        <events>\n          <event id=\"428859575\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[15 Aug 2026 - 11:00 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 10:15) FAME (Relaxed Screening)]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-15T11:00:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-15T10:15:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428859575</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute>Relaxed</event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687383/events/428859575/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687383/events/428859575.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173681155\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[FINDING EMILY]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<font size=\"5\"><b>Finding Emily&nbsp;</b></font><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/rnlq6zaok5yhu05v3113l8mosfz1/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre(s): Comedy/Romance</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">UK/USA | 2026 | 111 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director:&nbsp;Alicia MacDonald</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Cast: Angourie Rice, Spike Fearn, Minnie Driver, Phil Wang, Yali Topol Margalith</font></div><div><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\"><b><i>Our 7:30pm screening includes descriptive subtitles for those with hearing loss.</i></b></span></div><div><p><font size=\"3\">Just in time for summer,\nwe&rsquo;re thrilled to present <b><i>Finding Emily</i></b>, a homegrown romcom very\nmuch in the style of <i>Notting Hill</i> and <i>Rye Lane</i>. Set in\nManchester, the film follows Owen, a young musician who goes on a night out and\nmeets Emily, the girl of his dreams &mdash; only to discover the next\nmorning that the phone number she gave him is missing a digit. So, with the\nhelp of&nbsp;another&nbsp;Emily (a psychology student with her own motive for\njoining the hunt), he begins a quest across campus to find his elusive love.</font></p></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>film</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681155/events</url>\n        <version>52</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/a60yjkl954enjp8bja98sy2citlh/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/a60yjkl954enjp8bja98sy2citlh/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/a60yjkl954enjp8bja98sy2citlh/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/rnlq6zaok5yhu05v3113l8mosfz1/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/rnlq6zaok5yhu05v3113l8mosfz1/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/rnlq6zaok5yhu05v3113l8mosfz1/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n        </images>\n        <properties>\n          <property>\n            <name>Trailer</name>\n            <value>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-OGuJf70S0s</value>\n          </property>\n        </properties>\n        <events>\n          <event id=\"428839336\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[28 Jul 2026 - 14:30 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 13:45) FINDING EMILY]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-28T14:30:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-28T13:45:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428839336</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute></event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681155/events/428839336/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681155/events/428839336.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n          <event id=\"428839337\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[28 Jul 2026 - 19:30 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 18:45) FINDING EMILY]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-28T19:30:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-28T18:45:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428839337</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute>HoH Subtitled</event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681155/events/428839337/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681155/events/428839337.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173687743\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[FINDING EMILY (Babes-In-Arms Screening)]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<font size=\"5\"><b>Finding Emily&nbsp;</b></font><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/uenun1ak89jpy514j889c8403upo/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre(s): Comedy/Romance</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">UK/USA | 2026 | 111 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director:&nbsp;Alicia MacDonald</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Cast: Angourie Rice, Spike Fearn, Minnie Driver, Phil Wang, Yali Topol Margalith</font></div><div>\n<span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:medium;\">Just in time for summer, we&rsquo;re thrilled to present&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:medium;\"><i>Finding Emily</i></b><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:medium;\">, a homegrown romcom very much in the style of&nbsp;</span><i style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:medium;\">Notting Hill&nbsp;</i><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:medium;\">and&nbsp;</span><i style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:medium;\">Rye Lane</i><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:medium;\">. Set in Manchester, the film follows Owen, a young musician who goes on a night out and meets Emily, the girl of his dreams &mdash; only to discover the next morning that the phone number she gave him is missing a digit. So, with the help of&nbsp;another&nbsp;Emily (a psychology student with her own motive for joining the hunt), he begins a quest across campus to find his elusive love.</span>\n</div><div><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></div><div>\n<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Our Babes-in-Arms screenings are relaxed events allowing parents of babies 12 months &amp; under to watch a great movie without having to worry about what other customers think. We have space to securely park your buggies  and our Arts Bar is also open for refreshments you can take inside with you.</span><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:medium;\"></span>\n</div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>Babes-In-Arms</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687743/events</url>\n        <version>22</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/deon8qsvt8vi3s5kbwu68p8ovlnv/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/deon8qsvt8vi3s5kbwu68p8ovlnv/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/deon8qsvt8vi3s5kbwu68p8ovlnv/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/uenun1ak89jpy514j889c8403upo/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/uenun1ak89jpy514j889c8403upo/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/uenun1ak89jpy514j889c8403upo/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n        </images>\n        <properties>\n          <property>\n            <name>Trailer</name>\n            <value>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wc2UjmPzN8c</value>\n          </property>\n        </properties>\n        <events>\n          <event id=\"428859668\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[14 Aug 2026 - 11:00 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 10:15) FINDING EMILY (Babes-In-Arms Screening)]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-14T11:00:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-14T10:15:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428859668</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[Our Babes-in-Arms screenings are relaxed events allowing parents of babies 12 months & under to watch a great movie without having to worry about what other customers think. We have space to securely park your buggies  and our Arts Bar is also open for refreshments you can take inside with you.]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute>BiAs</event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687743/events/428859668/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687743/events/428859668.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173681148\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[FLIRTING]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<font size=\"5\"><b>Flirting&nbsp;</b></font><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/rvxz769pxp6mig0y0sc0rjgo5syr/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre(s): Romance/Drama</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Australia/UK | 1991 | 95 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director:&nbsp;John Duigan</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Cast:&nbsp;Noah Taylor, Nicole Kidman, Thandie Newton</font></div><div>\n<b><i>A 35mm presentation in association with The Cinema Museum.&nbsp;</i></b><font size=\"3\"></font>\n</div><div><p><font size=\"3\">The second\nautobiographical film by Duigan after <i>The Year My Voice Broke</i>. Taylor\nagain plays Danny, now at a rural boarding school, where he meets Thandiwe, the\nrebellious daughter of African parents, who studies at the nearby Girl&rsquo;s\ncollege. Before long a romance develops between the two, who must get around\nthe rules of both institutions to see each other. This tender and perceptive\nfilm sees early performances from female stars Kidman and Newton, as well as\nNaomi Watts.&nbsp;</font></p></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>35mm Film</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681148/events</url>\n        <version>53</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/8begmnpav8f7tgzinfzk16cc6ifd/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/8begmnpav8f7tgzinfzk16cc6ifd/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/8begmnpav8f7tgzinfzk16cc6ifd/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/rvxz769pxp6mig0y0sc0rjgo5syr/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/rvxz769pxp6mig0y0sc0rjgo5syr/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/rvxz769pxp6mig0y0sc0rjgo5syr/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n        </images>\n        <properties>\n          <property>\n            <name>Trailer</name>\n            <value>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GkYrFka6Ukw</value>\n          </property>\n        </properties>\n        <events>\n          <event id=\"428839323\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[11 Jul 2026 - 14:00 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 13:15) FLIRTING]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-11T14:00:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-11T13:15:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428839323</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[A 35mm film presentation in association with The Cinema Museum. ]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute>35mm film</event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681148/events/428839323/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681148/events/428839323.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173681144\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[GHOST (Relaxed Screening)]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<b><font size=\"5\">Ghost&nbsp;</font></b><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/yvxrhnddt01xb05razzqapj8hewu/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre(s): Thriller/Romance</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">USA | 1990 | 126 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director:&nbsp;Jerry Zucker</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Cast:&nbsp;Patrick Swayze, Demi Moore, Whoopi Goldberg</font></div><div><p><font size=\"3\">A sleeper hit at the time of its release, the film<b><i>\n</i></b>follows the ghost of banker Sam Wheat as he tries to ensure the safety\nof his girlfriend Molly from the man who arranged his murder &mdash; with\nthe help of charlatan psychic Oda Mae Brown (played by the Oscar-winning Whoopi\nGoldberg). A poignant romance, mixed with elements of comedy, horror, and\nmystery, <b><i>Ghost</i></b> was a popular hit both in cinemas and on VHS.</font></p></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>Relaxed Screening</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681144/events</url>\n        <version>79</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/i1c8t7dblyii9k2cmkijs5puqeu7/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/i1c8t7dblyii9k2cmkijs5puqeu7/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/i1c8t7dblyii9k2cmkijs5puqeu7/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/yvxrhnddt01xb05razzqapj8hewu/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/yvxrhnddt01xb05razzqapj8hewu/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/yvxrhnddt01xb05razzqapj8hewu/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n        </images>\n        <properties>\n          <property>\n            <name>Trailer</name>\n            <value>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=capS3yV9eY8</value>\n          </property>\n        </properties>\n        <events>\n          <event id=\"428839316\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[18 Jul 2026 - 11:00 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 10:15) GHOST (Relaxed Screening)]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-18T11:00:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-07-18T10:15:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428839316</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[This is a relaxed screening for those members of the neurodiverse community, but all are welcome.]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute>Relaxed Screening</event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681144/events/428839316/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681144/events/428839316.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173687750\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[ISH]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<font size=\"5\">Ish&nbsp;</font><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/79djul89kzsfskat0ufblfe08vy2/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre: Drama</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">UK | 2025 | 89 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director:&nbsp;Imran Perretta</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Stars:&nbsp;Farhan Hasnat, Yahya Kitana, Sudha Bhuchar</font></div><div><p><font size=\"3\">Set in Luton, this coming-of-age drama\nfollows 12-year-old best friends Ish and Maram (non-professional actors Farhan\nHasnat and Yahya Kitana, themselves friends since childhood) as they try to\nmake the most of their summer. After a traumatic police stop-and-search\nincident, cracks begin to appear in their friendship, forcing the boys to\nconfront the realities of growing up in a world that views them with\nsuspicion.As their lives gradually\ndiverge, each must make sense of the men they are becoming and learn that\nletting go can be one of the hardest parts of growing up. A contemporary\nportrait of British childhood exploring masculinity, friendship and racial\nprofiling and facial recognition technology with compassion and insight.</font></p></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category></event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687750/events</url>\n        <version>20</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/5sgwf0dovud3xegqr5du1ucajfy4/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/5sgwf0dovud3xegqr5du1ucajfy4/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/5sgwf0dovud3xegqr5du1ucajfy4/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/79djul89kzsfskat0ufblfe08vy2/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/79djul89kzsfskat0ufblfe08vy2/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/79d