nt></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director:&nbsp;David Frankel</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Cast:&nbsp;Meryl Streep, Anne Hathaway, Emily Blunt, and Stanley Tucci</font></div><div>\n<i><b><font size=\"2\">Our Thursday 2pm screening includes descriptive subtitles for those with hearing loss and a post-film discussion in association with the U3A film group</font><font size=\"3\">. </font><font size=\"2\">Anyone can stay and join in.</font></b></i>\n</div><div><p><font size=\"3\">Twenty years on, <b><i>The Devil Wears Prada 2</i></b>\nstruts back onto the scene with its original cast and a fresh dose of\nhigh-fashion drama. Miranda Priestly (Meryl Streep) &mdash; ice-cold stare intact &mdash;\nis fighting to keep her fashion magazine Runway relevant as the print media\nworld crumbles. Her former prot&eacute;g&eacute; Anne Hathaway returns in considerably better\nshoes, but it&apos;s former assistant-turned-rival Emily Blunt who may prove\nMiranda&apos;s most formidable foe yet. Stilettos are sharpened, alliances tested,\nand the drama is more fabulous than ever.<b></b></font></p></div><div><br></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>film</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173680627/events</url>\n        <version>93</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/jkr0ljp0io6asnae8zb11lu3ahuc/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/jkr0ljp0io6asnae8zb11lu3ahuc/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/jkr0ljp0io6asnae8zb11lu3ahuc/7c367cff06fd518c1c