nbsp;</font></p></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>Animated Film</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687746/events</url>\n        <version>29</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/q281ythjrjmu4ihtkigh013y7k1l/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/q281ythjrjmu4ihtkigh013y7k1l/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/q281ythjrjmu4ihtkigh013y7k1l/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/klgzv4y7onq08z022j6f4x3umasv/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/klgzv4y7onq08z022j6f4x3umasv/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/klgzv4y7onq08z022j6f4x3umasv/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n        </images>\n        <properties>\n          <property>\n            <name>Trailer</name>\n            <value>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QftAW9TTmuQ</value>\n          </property>\n        </properties>\n        <events>\n          <event id=\"428859675\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[20 Aug 2026 - 11:00 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 10:15) TOY STORY 5]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-20T11:00:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-20T10:15:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428859675</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute></event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687746/events/428859675/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687746/events/428859675.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n          <event id=\"428859673\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[20 Aug 2026 - 14:30 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 13:45) TOY STORY 5]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-20T14:30:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-20T13:45:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428859673</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute>HoH Subtitled</event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687746/events/428859673/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687746/events/428859673.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n          <event id=\"428859674\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[20 Aug 2026 - 19:30 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 18:45) TOY STORY 5]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-20T19:30:00+01:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"IST\">2026-08-20T18:45:00+01:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428859674</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute></event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687746/events/428859674/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173687746/events/428859674.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173681151\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[TUNER]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<b><font size=\"5\">Tuner&nbsp;</font></b><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/3gulz41w3pya81o04orn9ffrk0wa/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre(s):&nbsp;Crime/Drama/Music/Romance/Thriller</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Canada/USA | 2025 | 109 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director:&nbsp;Daniel Roher</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Cast:&nbsp;Leo Woodall, Dustin Hoffman, Havana Rose Liu.</font></div><div><b><i><font size=\"2\">Our 7:30pm screening includes descriptive subtitles for those with hearing loss.</font></i></b></div><div><p><font size=\"3\">Niki, a young piano tuner and apprentice to octogenarian\nHarry, suffers from an extreme auditory sensitivity. This hyperacusis aids his\nwork but when Harry falls ill, it accidentally presents Niki with a way to pay\nmounting medical bills as he cracks safes for Uri and his suspect security\nfirm. The central relationship between Niki and concert pianist and aspiring\ncomposer Ruthie rings true in its complexity as the tension builds. Stylishly\nshot with snappy editing and a cracking score, this debut feature cleverly\ncombines taut suspense and relationship drama in present day New York.&nbsp;</font></p></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>film</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173681151/events</url>\n        <version>50</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/tz5io0fq04sgwljoe1vos9cwr3yi/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/tz5io0fq04sgwljoe1vos9cwr3yi/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/tz5io0fq04sgwljoe1vos9cwr3yi/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/3gulz41w3pya81o04orn9ffrk0wa/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/3gulz41w3pya81o04orn9ffrk0wa/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/3gulz41w3pya81o04orn9ffrk0wa/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n        </images>\n        <properties>\n          <property>\n            <name>Trailer</name>\n            <value>https://www.youtube.com/watch